{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121076","id":4011295875,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7vF4SD","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121076","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121076.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121076.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121076","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121076/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121076/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121076/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3f0e3c85a7426f7538a1d22160bfc1e29ae726c2","number":121076,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Expose `ResourceLoader::get_resource_type` to scripting","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Most `ResourceFormatLoader::get_resource_type` override implementations provide a lightweight way to return the resource's type without loading the resource's path. \r\n\r\nIn our scripting language, we support `preload` just like GDScript. In this code path, we don't want to load our full script at this step, as this needs to be done at the right inheritance analysis position.  However, we need to know whether the resource is one of our language's scripts. If we were to call `ResourceLoader::load` to get the loaded class' class type, this would trigger the full load and deserialization of that script, which would cascade into its own parser and analysis phase. \r\n\r\nExposing `ResourceLoader::get_resource_type` would delegate the call to all registered loaders and provide the same mechanism that GDScript's analyzer uses today.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gi